{"source":"github","project_id":"itdepends","target":"r-lib/itdepends","id":"issue/6","ref":6,"title":"Missing dependency on pkgcache?","description":"A little ironically, I had to install another dependency to get `dep_weight()` to work:\r\n\r\n```r\r\nremotes::install_github(\"jimhester/itdepends\")\r\nitdepends::dep_usage_pkg(\"googleAuthR\") %\u003e% count(pkg, sort=TRUE)\r\nitdepends::dep_weight(c(\"googleAuthR\",\"googleAnalyticsR\",\"googleLanguageR\"))\r\nError in loadNamespace(name) : there is no package called ‘pkgcache’\r\n\r\ninstall.packages(\"pkgcache\")\r\nitdepends::dep_weight(c(\"googleAuthR\",\"googleAnalyticsR\",\"googleLanguageR\"))\r\n# all good\r\n```","published_at":"2019-01-19T15:55:49Z","updated_at":"2019-01-25T14:41:53Z","url":"https://github.com/r-lib/itdepends/issues/6","type":"issue","extra":{"author":"MarkEdmondson1234","state":"CLOSED"}}
